{"id": "nat_0", "text": "The birch canoe slid on the smooth planks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.231259346008301, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3863682643745814, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6483018286457596, "dnsmos_bak": 4.143272990952323}
{"id": "nat_1", "text": "Glue the sheet to the dark blue background.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.379194259643555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3520892227736936, "dnsmos_sig": 3.639457301025052, "dnsmos_bak": 4.115115203374482}
{"id": "nat_2", "text": "It is easy to tell the depth of a well.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.346362113952637, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.403157139994464, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6419746163283193, "dnsmos_bak": 4.15956850701157}
{"id": "nat_3", "text": "These days a chicken leg is a rare dish.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.472522735595703, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.28480068124722, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6021353106638605, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9951614611977844}
{"id": "nat_4", "text": "Rice is often served in round bowls.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.368433475494385, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3990463931426507, "dnsmos_sig": 3.653000620037387, "dnsmos_bak": 4.088240975497994}
{"id": "nat_5", "text": "The juice of lemons makes fine punch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.441860198974609, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.372501718047515, "dnsmos_sig": 3.616998918517731, "dnsmos_bak": 4.118981222839663}
{"id": "nat_6", "text": "The box was thrown beside the parked truck.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.272046089172363, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.254557031485566, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5312172573028935, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0792764408867646}
{"id": "nat_7", "text": "The hogs were fed chopped corn and garbage.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6006349206349206, "utmos": 4.346285820007324, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3558488542308873, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5890242405987025, "dnsmos_bak": 4.174659396718365}
{"id": "nat_8", "text": "Four hours of steady work faced us.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.329897880554199, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.249786610433367, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5579245222127254, "dnsmos_bak": 3.976341149611401}
{"id": "nat_9", "text": "Large size in stockings is hard to sell.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.362683296203613, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.497773011293021, "dnsmos_sig": 3.727398182395378, "dnsmos_bak": 4.190175909346107}
{"id": "nat_10", "text": "The boy was there when the sun rose.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.328726768493652, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2109373550771907, "dnsmos_sig": 3.580025573246971, "dnsmos_bak": 3.837034856474859}
{"id": "nat_11", "text": "A rod is used to catch pink salmon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.4156317710876465, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.316728889098823, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5910179535151694, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1022316184728105}
{"id": "nat_12", "text": "The source of the huge river is the clear spring.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.423901557922363, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.19654929879895, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5100656283263025, "dnsmos_bak": 3.940106789786044}
{"id": "nat_13", "text": "Kick the ball straight and follow through.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.304318428039551, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.256483528442142, "dnsmos_sig": 3.514212272395856, "dnsmos_bak": 4.10657382355921}
{"id": "nat_14", "text": "Help the woman get back to her feet.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.289445877075195, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3038367746737562, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5534570120192255, "dnsmos_bak": 4.147275980671829}
{"id": "nat_15", "text": "A blue crane is a tall wading bird.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.4131760597229, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.283627351868285, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5669024349616936, "dnsmos_bak": 4.094409937629719}
{"id": "nat_16", "text": "It is hard to erase blue or red ink.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.01187801361084, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.204044934840683, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5119889845836276, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0398742245113075}
{"id": "nat_17", "text": "Write quickly and meet me at the dock.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.378993034362793, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4537702640937447, "dnsmos_sig": 3.685085270215219, "dnsmos_bak": 4.184751466411948}
{"id": "nat_18", "text": "The two talked quietly in the dim light.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.296363830566406, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.352548882624218, "dnsmos_sig": 3.601593794900818, "dnsmos_bak": 4.146829959888279}
{"id": "nat_19", "text": "The hail pattered on the burnt red tiles.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.327445983886719, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1107208582933685, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5838588574287273, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7509889396068887}
{"id": "nat_20", "text": "The sand drifted down the steep slope.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.319098472595215, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.30617466936138, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6031975728850822, "dnsmos_bak": 4.09737311609428}
{"id": "nat_21", "text": "Oak is strong and also gives shade.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.36595344543457, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1636484950110124, "dnsmos_sig": 3.654490049035774, "dnsmos_bak": 3.75933484154739}
{"id": "nat_22", "text": "Cats and dogs each hate the other.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.352884292602539, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.303373673171817, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5621424395594388, "dnsmos_bak": 4.135925449591151}
{"id": "nat_23", "text": "The pipe began to rust while new.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.39052152633667, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.219631679832273, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5615103545148705, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9422251269274846}
{"id": "nat_24", "text": "Open the crate but don't break the glass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.206320285797119, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.290725647066235, "dnsmos_sig": 3.554967619257906, "dnsmos_bak": 4.139158413885812}
{"id": "nat_25", "text": "Add the sum to the product of these three.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.328890800476074, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.352785691690489, "dnsmos_sig": 3.623431748106519, "dnsmos_bak": 4.11936690731069}
{"id": "nat_26", "text": "Thieves who rob friends deserve jail.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.335146903991699, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.277584176833303, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5758655530478327, "dnsmos_bak": 4.062455619908266}
{"id": "nat_27", "text": "The ripe taste of cheese improves with age.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6006349206349206, "utmos": 4.425829887390137, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2716084643902277, "dnsmos_sig": 3.55151088174725, "dnsmos_bak": 4.038177925264841}
{"id": "nat_28", "text": "Act on these orders with great speed.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.237945556640625, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3335993498527876, "dnsmos_sig": 3.603557226532482, "dnsmos_bak": 4.109614797384989}
{"id": "nat_29", "text": "The hush of night came on the water.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.294315338134766, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.392331806289484, "dnsmos_sig": 3.68627814001122, "dnsmos_bak": 4.098843094369714}
{"id": "nat_30", "text": "Flax makes linen for many a dress.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.3682966232299805, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.302328840091871, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5851603094845714, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0045909536735165}
{"id": "nat_31", "text": "Hoist the load to your left shoulder.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.385277271270752, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3807892319976522, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6535221689368336, "dnsmos_bak": 4.165195027953554}
{"id": "nat_32", "text": "Take the winding path to reach the lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.393380641937256, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.274125245902446, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5402738244369423, "dnsmos_bak": 4.094419325257364}
{"id": "nat_33", "text": "Note closely the size of the gas tank.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.368348598480225, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3075120435226486, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5732812142432633, "dnsmos_bak": 4.111000128304132}
{"id": "nat_34", "text": "Wipe the grease off his dirty face.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.287318229675293, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.125433785003203, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4678776610031967, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8749877084363247}
{"id": "nat_35", "text": "Mend the coat before wearing it again.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.368932723999023, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.398011677383047, "dnsmos_sig": 3.643449875946962, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1662248942383}
{"id": "nat_36", "text": "The lease ran out in sixteen weeks.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.191354751586914, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2275469645291452, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5979742204054745, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9210023564093945}
{"id": "nat_37", "text": "Both parts of the design came together.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.206409931182861, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3419859005947985, "dnsmos_sig": 3.594440131400196, "dnsmos_bak": 4.157124286451409}
{"id": "nat_38", "text": "Sewing hems and darns takes skill.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.387119770050049, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.398102823858689, "dnsmos_sig": 3.621040237044429, "dnsmos_bak": 4.159188623703218}
{"id": "nat_39", "text": "The architect planned a new city hall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.416017532348633, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3561678095086314, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6521129521058198, "dnsmos_bak": 4.086283281381962}
{"id": "nat_40", "text": "The small red lamp stood in a corner.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.248519420623779, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4015257666626186, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6726258670653356, "dnsmos_bak": 4.138245926267197}
{"id": "nat_41", "text": "The large box came by truck to town.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.33543062210083, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.422975842513251, "dnsmos_sig": 3.704573317405687, "dnsmos_bak": 4.184897106322806}
{"id": "nat_42", "text": "The men fought hard to save the fort.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.360564708709717, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3356114663094907, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6507817565460243, "dnsmos_bak": 4.068449125003283}
{"id": "nat_43", "text": "The horse chewed his bit and nodded.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.183916091918945, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2522619801224026, "dnsmos_sig": 3.581117525731746, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9541682731042997}
{"id": "nat_44", "text": "Three of the men were hurt badly.", "audio_duration_s": 1.5789569160997732, "utmos": 4.388833522796631, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9360687553812057, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5241546239314423, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5477162535945745}
{"id": "nat_45", "text": "Ripe pears are fit for a queen's table.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.293657302856445, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.273209886118522, "dnsmos_sig": 3.57839708395612, "dnsmos_bak": 4.094555608423768}
{"id": "nat_46", "text": "The dark room was lit by a red light.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.270595550537109, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.990729735731394, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3942835733301613, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8239203895833165}
{"id": "nat_47", "text": "The fox hid in the tall grass nearby.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.171164035797119, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0100098516095577, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5400932074733653, "dnsmos_bak": 3.611046969561603}
{"id": "nat_48", "text": "We saw eight tiny goats on the hillside.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.387754440307617, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.391846299498305, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6639460916824746, "dnsmos_bak": 4.113677174976705}
{"id": "nat_49", "text": "The cats purred softly on the warm rug.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.267829895019531, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2581556000236604, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5404409085203636, "dnsmos_bak": 4.096589751954704}
{"id": "nat_50", "text": "The silver bell rang at dawn.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 3.9880211353302, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.237249757376825, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6132079400448167, "dnsmos_bak": 3.973242742066877}
{"id": "nat_51", "text": "The crowd cheered the band with pride.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.402827739715576, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.390771244649894, "dnsmos_sig": 3.645428706455783, "dnsmos_bak": 4.156026937305656}
{"id": "nat_52", "text": "She baked fresh bread every morning.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.372808456420898, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.198789693646316, "dnsmos_sig": 3.506675508737672, "dnsmos_bak": 4.026681138248701}
{"id": "nat_53", "text": "The train reached the bridge at noon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.435842514038086, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3140918852776022, "dnsmos_sig": 3.547468172757508, "dnsmos_bak": 4.147940975881186}
{"id": "nat_54", "text": "Cool winds blew from the distant peaks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.375362396240234, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3641408513065603, "dnsmos_sig": 3.613056729538268, "dnsmos_bak": 4.15010145925582}
{"id": "nat_55", "text": "The old dog slept by the warm fire.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.226129531860352, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3393325637375026, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6338542664126408, "dnsmos_bak": 4.098041284625156}
{"id": "nat_56", "text": "Bright stars filled the clear night sky.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.360838890075684, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2422871329713123, "dnsmos_sig": 3.560395948580074, "dnsmos_bak": 4.01487726355843}
{"id": "nat_57", "text": "The child built a castle in the sand.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.294638156890869, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4800369277791794, "dnsmos_sig": 3.7749006011621002, "dnsmos_bak": 4.143460779491304}
{"id": "nat_58", "text": "Rain soaked the dry and barren plain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.419997692108154, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4070357095928707, "dnsmos_sig": 3.658781069244128, "dnsmos_bak": 4.172130791954823}
{"id": "nat_59", "text": "The boat moved quietly past the shore.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.25961446762085, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.355302813546048, "dnsmos_sig": 3.621182166013461, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1595384236454995}
{"id": "nat_60", "text": "Plums ripen in the warm summer sun.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.180943965911865, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1686453163278077, "dnsmos_sig": 3.569590230950159, "dnsmos_bak": 3.861273587064993}
{"id": "nat_61", "text": "The lock was jammed but opened at last.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.39805793762207, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.292904512854156, "dnsmos_sig": 3.58097719531683, "dnsmos_bak": 4.092726134658035}
{"id": "nat_62", "text": "The key to the cabinet was misplaced.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.3119797706604, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.223919174820805, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4968244317040793, "dnsmos_bak": 4.081724516129391}
{"id": "nat_63", "text": "The cup shattered on the stone floor.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.319614410400391, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.317220899290587, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6750769007973196, "dnsmos_bak": 3.97278479497041}
{"id": "nat_64", "text": "A black bear crossed the narrow trail.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.344480991363525, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3195708674821516, "dnsmos_sig": 3.576425107060748, "dnsmos_bak": 4.137967574662623}
{"id": "nat_65", "text": "Fresh dew glistened on the green leaves.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.409010887145996, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.239240976658085, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5957265570692925, "dnsmos_bak": 3.900838203567211}
{"id": "nat_66", "text": "The lamp cast a soft glow on the table.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.326383590698242, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4116649430064507, "dnsmos_sig": 3.689996785715249, "dnsmos_bak": 4.161197242961379}
{"id": "nat_67", "text": "Strong winds bent the tall pine trees.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.374105453491211, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.970928076683258, "dnsmos_sig": 3.51847465152433, "dnsmos_bak": 3.554869799326515}
{"id": "nat_68", "text": "A robin sang from the old oak branch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.237504005432129, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1100758603285277, "dnsmos_sig": 3.436044929591401, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8921118375141894}
{"id": "nat_69", "text": "The crowd fell silent when he spoke.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.314087390899658, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.360299820049871, "dnsmos_sig": 3.622774725233466, "dnsmos_bak": 4.159733602011863}
{"id": "nat_70", "text": "Green fields stretched to the far horizon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6006349206349206, "utmos": 4.389342308044434, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0943869507267823, "dnsmos_sig": 3.543014173366843, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7609905773657193}
{"id": "nat_71", "text": "The river ran swift and cold today.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.244875907897949, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3667890447301723, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6455571058112666, "dnsmos_bak": 4.12609202583356}
{"id": "nat_72", "text": "The flag waved high in the morning breeze.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.348701477050781, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8844406297980933, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5330243158502657, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3985258151491506}
{"id": "nat_73", "text": "Blue jays flew low over the meadow.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.387093544006348, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1004804529258414, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5047467333181475, "dnsmos_bak": 3.805843824736416}
{"id": "nat_74", "text": "The forge was lit at break of day.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.337813377380371, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2227787179240535, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5669614890886194, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9741821704461033}
{"id": "nat_75", "text": "The sparrows hopped on the garden wall.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.193577289581299, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.5294234088884315, "dnsmos_sig": 3.7557505893830525, "dnsmos_bak": 4.197581564147947}
{"id": "nat_76", "text": "Fill the car before you drive into town.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.292180061340332, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3319022698176943, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6362538179444464, "dnsmos_bak": 4.067814342883105}
{"id": "nat_77", "text": "A cud of grass hung from the heifer's lip.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.307051658630371, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.515148285177734, "dnsmos_sig": 3.73329687307647, "dnsmos_bak": 4.215995619156534}
{"id": "nat_78", "text": "The seed grew into a giant oak tree.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.4078288078308105, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9746583159594127, "dnsmos_sig": 3.462930310892289, "dnsmos_bak": 3.644060193237777}
{"id": "nat_79", "text": "A worm ate through the wooden plank.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.290485382080078, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2893451832527547, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5634229006786162, "dnsmos_bak": 4.147692267377446}
{"id": "nat_80", "text": "The team scored in the last few seconds.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.362661361694336, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.412227882632034, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6876219945167086, "dnsmos_bak": 4.088978967613347}
{"id": "nat_81", "text": "The glass jar held the bright red jam.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 3.987760305404663, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.392881080104492, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6481297713754093, "dnsmos_bak": 4.142917175564149}
{"id": "nat_82", "text": "The leaves fell slowly in the autumn air.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.335493564605713, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0801784129002145, "dnsmos_sig": 3.618537626886518, "dnsmos_bak": 3.663944175434093}
{"id": "nat_83", "text": "The farmer planted seeds in long rows.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.372505187988281, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.349646804980184, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6353231902915524, "dnsmos_bak": 4.106175782686718}
{"id": "nat_84", "text": "The clock struck twelve at midnight.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.146814823150635, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3365884047019785, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6110469361701925, "dnsmos_bak": 4.173972086845766}
{"id": "nat_85", "text": "A pale moon rose over the distant hills.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.374393463134766, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.888548942508161, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4609557079105766, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5190624996696065}
{"id": "nat_86", "text": "The stream carved a path through the stone.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.367457389831543, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.296786799128287, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5752662487294247, "dnsmos_bak": 4.133159321829197}
{"id": "nat_87", "text": "Bright flowers bloomed along the fence.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.297950744628906, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2483915007784376, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5684748248257745, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9976022224637906}
{"id": "nat_88", "text": "The snow lay deep on the mountain pass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.291170597076416, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3775954529680794, "dnsmos_sig": 3.684439097061262, "dnsmos_bak": 4.066970666452837}
{"id": "nat_89", "text": "The eagle soared above the canyon rim.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.170162200927734, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2248868291730948, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5800890443172713, "dnsmos_bak": 3.96805407517429}
{"id": "nat_90", "text": "The gate swung open with a loud creak.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.276559829711914, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.286777997478553, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5831488673762215, "dnsmos_bak": 4.111730986776716}
{"id": "nat_91", "text": "The wolf howled at the cold winter moon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 3.921175003051758, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3839792626542047, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4418137766991115, "dnsmos_bak": 2.641381277089086}
{"id": "nat_92", "text": "A candle flickered in the draft of wind.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.329173564910889, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.421586444106754, "dnsmos_sig": 3.683805503047126, "dnsmos_bak": 4.132571272538994}
{"id": "nat_93", "text": "The road curved sharply past the barn.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.3188300132751465, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4163664175889408, "dnsmos_sig": 3.668512811446681, "dnsmos_bak": 4.17583554180961}
{"id": "nat_94", "text": "Wool is spun into yarn for warm cloth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.338968276977539, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3261872483320043, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6438186712269305, "dnsmos_bak": 4.019556029276639}
{"id": "nat_95", "text": "The crowd surged through the narrow gate.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.324820041656494, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2511838814516105, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5747667296300185, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9937770591619497}
{"id": "nat_96", "text": "The owl hunted mice in the dark field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 3.8720011711120605, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1867018340019153, "dnsmos_sig": 3.578025176343091, "dnsmos_bak": 3.893757918422338}
{"id": "nat_97", "text": "The pond froze solid in January.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.432584762573242, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3272397589573157, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6486813723739657, "dnsmos_bak": 4.061892795895851}
{"id": "nat_98", "text": "A flock of geese flew in a V-shape.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 4.3151445388793945, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4495743744966147, "dnsmos_sig": 3.684749519541958, "dnsmos_bak": 4.132592294135324}
{"id": "nat_99", "text": "The tide ebbed low on the rocky coast.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.302129745483398, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.475241556237677, "dnsmos_sig": 3.7132470262837973, "dnsmos_bak": 4.148346264186312}
{"id": "nat_100", "text": "The flame burned bright in the dark cave.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.2278828620910645, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2759881865977043, "dnsmos_sig": 3.584283376027847, "dnsmos_bak": 4.108410474561748}
{"id": "nat_101", "text": "The mill ground grain into fine flour.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.1501312255859375, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3564565127413046, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6561801617268617, "dnsmos_bak": 4.097517424866335}
{"id": "nat_102", "text": "The stag grazed near the edge of the wood.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.413518905639648, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3101831468802274, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6188106472860837, "dnsmos_bak": 4.065464182851857}
{"id": "nat_103", "text": "The well dried up in the hot summer.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.04307746887207, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2940129238210094, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6527310640462014, "dnsmos_bak": 4.004045188630587}
{"id": "nat_104", "text": "The swift brown fox ran past the log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.3655476570129395, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.289485739132154, "dnsmos_sig": 3.559968289084537, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1095652667566664}
{"id": "nat_105", "text": "A stone wall bordered the old estate.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.403396129608154, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.995979289105969, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5175951423941263, "dnsmos_bak": 3.661305301417222}
{"id": "nat_106", "text": "The bell rang twice before it stopped.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.338805675506592, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2888696543254006, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5817269774349527, "dnsmos_bak": 4.075582338905174}
{"id": "nat_107", "text": "The hawk soared high on the warm updraft.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6006349206349206, "utmos": 4.312808990478516, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.5180210248953028, "dnsmos_sig": 3.764360756052708, "dnsmos_bak": 4.219338797250328}
{"id": "nat_108", "text": "The sharp knife cut the rough cord.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.27745246887207, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.263519319510376, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5747915446663683, "dnsmos_bak": 4.085193127962144}
{"id": "nat_109", "text": "The colt pranced in the wide green field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.372585296630859, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4050866271673237, "dnsmos_sig": 3.664285768824405, "dnsmos_bak": 4.140655721151117}
{"id": "nat_110", "text": "A fish leaped from the calm blue lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.303778648376465, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2309868711566216, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5687898857190867, "dnsmos_bak": 4.035694504683321}
{"id": "nat_111", "text": "The damp ground smelled of fresh rain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.365451812744141, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3808697947252275, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6459678781483036, "dnsmos_bak": 4.110787175930609}
{"id": "nat_112", "text": "The cart was loaded with heavy stone.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.223017692565918, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2720880732910573, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5302579935576865, "dnsmos_bak": 4.098622696716245}
{"id": "nat_113", "text": "The long white rope coiled on the deck.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.321226596832275, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.209159971527523, "dnsmos_sig": 3.55619336093656, "dnsmos_bak": 3.993836684991447}
{"id": "nat_114", "text": "The pine tree grew tall and straight.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.398426532745361, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.443346844800581, "dnsmos_sig": 3.672622443762041, "dnsmos_bak": 4.174181266082731}
{"id": "nat_115", "text": "The coal burned slowly in the iron stove.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.192014694213867, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6862504540824887, "dnsmos_sig": 3.541095978460985, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9684505035037465}
{"id": "nat_116", "text": "A gust of wind tore the sail apart.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.413260459899902, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4048110429386824, "dnsmos_sig": 3.673222316869482, "dnsmos_bak": 4.145353622768305}
{"id": "nat_117", "text": "The goat climbed steep rocky paths easily.", "audio_duration_s": 2.786394557823129, "utmos": 4.46441650390625, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.295586102274201, "dnsmos_sig": 3.552684336817996, "dnsmos_bak": 4.136108110991846}
{"id": "nat_118", "text": "The red sun sank below the flat plain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.296351909637451, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3778546812323986, "dnsmos_sig": 3.650063172773698, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1715539285287075}
{"id": "nat_119", "text": "The wheat field swayed in the warm breeze.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.280540943145752, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9807435223038596, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4870156090254447, "dnsmos_bak": 3.647669186937923}
{"id": "nat_120", "text": "The thick fog rolled in from the sea.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.286259174346924, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.154317375027473, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5769668883082963, "dnsmos_bak": 3.765559147063603}
{"id": "nat_121", "text": "The drum beat loud and steady all night.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.33316707611084, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.321617665508384, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5982986275456086, "dnsmos_bak": 4.115043679757883}
{"id": "nat_122", "text": "The fox left tracks in the new snow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.216637134552002, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.350532201835663, "dnsmos_sig": 3.62399193847438, "dnsmos_bak": 4.125902787281586}
{"id": "nat_123", "text": "The light faded as the sun went down.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.1703290939331055, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.369798805478138, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6173513247088183, "dnsmos_bak": 4.139486190243332}
{"id": "nat_124", "text": "A small boat drifted on the still lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.2190446853637695, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2865569700901354, "dnsmos_sig": 3.618251857706504, "dnsmos_bak": 4.004669298023551}
{"id": "nat_125", "text": "The cook prepared a fresh pot of soup.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 3.6546475887298584, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.275755368214811, "dnsmos_sig": 3.556914273616546, "dnsmos_bak": 4.100882241828726}
{"id": "nat_126", "text": "The old mill wheel turned in the stream.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.338204860687256, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0684094332459884, "dnsmos_sig": 3.53983149606768, "dnsmos_bak": 3.697628165161741}
{"id": "nat_127", "text": "The long drought burned the crops dry.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.341911792755127, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.457417844711938, "dnsmos_sig": 3.682891254847694, "dnsmos_bak": 4.203253808142911}
{"id": "nat_128", "text": "The cool air smelled of pine and earth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.29226016998291, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2358009322464487, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5694620160710837, "dnsmos_bak": 4.014477577109541}
{"id": "nat_129", "text": "The child ran barefoot in the wet grass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.3933515548706055, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2861019938884417, "dnsmos_sig": 3.605936624186774, "dnsmos_bak": 4.026813780502757}
{"id": "nat_130", "text": "A kite soared high above the park.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.241327285766602, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3049065842106473, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5877640944675204, "dnsmos_bak": 4.131431555340699}
{"id": "nat_131", "text": "The bridge shook as the truck rolled past.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.35693359375, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4911618912738795, "dnsmos_sig": 3.709022101815293, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1928791423480485}
{"id": "nat_132", "text": "The soft light fell on the open book.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.313776016235352, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1035338667965204, "dnsmos_sig": 3.514981492070455, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8740948045883434}
{"id": "nat_133", "text": "The crane lifted the heavy steel beam.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.440167427062988, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1938326536546335, "dnsmos_sig": 3.559090189496646, "dnsmos_bak": 3.953792666434066}
{"id": "nat_134", "text": "The strong horse pulled the loaded cart.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.077365398406982, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3893471316380834, "dnsmos_sig": 3.659141401617306, "dnsmos_bak": 4.156595727269673}
{"id": "nat_135", "text": "The wind died down as night came on.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.409773826599121, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.19700295416856, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5735415670716337, "dnsmos_bak": 3.949540907061648}
{"id": "nat_136", "text": "The bird built its nest in the fork of the branch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.325150489807129, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3968754746298266, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6644917358176388, "dnsmos_bak": 4.128560336181396}
{"id": "nat_137", "text": "The ice was thin near the river bank.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.345870494842529, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2582475233197066, "dnsmos_sig": 3.547399014269142, "dnsmos_bak": 4.017296681703629}
{"id": "nat_138", "text": "The fog lifted slowly as the sun rose.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.290689468383789, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3002555856501163, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5913350591613127, "dnsmos_bak": 4.056959355151421}
{"id": "nat_139", "text": "The fire crackled in the stone hearth.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.26058292388916, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.446012783680827, "dnsmos_sig": 3.7224137135692823, "dnsmos_bak": 4.156607342036926}
{"id": "nat_140", "text": "The long bridge arched over the bay.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.33814001083374, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.399080677048287, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6453777033797508, "dnsmos_bak": 4.171335052167767}
{"id": "nat_141", "text": "A cloud of dust rose from the dry road.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.3146772384643555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.365285596256661, "dnsmos_sig": 3.615304598658066, "dnsmos_bak": 4.143072361455873}
{"id": "nat_142", "text": "The swift stream ran over smooth stones.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.238641262054443, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.170931882009771, "dnsmos_sig": 3.520606646045134, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9222932699527915}
{"id": "nat_143", "text": "The torch cast shadows on the old wall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.435182571411133, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4018753677412605, "dnsmos_sig": 3.652138690022888, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1467547179261635}
{"id": "nat_144", "text": "The net was full of silver fish.", "audio_duration_s": 1.5789569160997732, "utmos": 4.184818267822266, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0366041505311507, "dnsmos_sig": 3.57486722773254, "dnsmos_bak": 3.564722214706352}
{"id": "nat_145", "text": "The tall grain stood ripe in the field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.3006696701049805, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.342542708974734, "dnsmos_sig": 3.635084830488132, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0957523931149264}
{"id": "nat_146", "text": "The damp cloth wiped the dusty shelf.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.348714828491211, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3818195187450435, "dnsmos_sig": 3.629948157997082, "dnsmos_bak": 4.135493840445963}
{"id": "nat_147", "text": "A mule team pulled the heavy plow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.353760719299316, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3886199659158387, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6489282334071853, "dnsmos_bak": 4.153292760144422}
{"id": "nat_148", "text": "The old chair sat in the corner unused.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.362214088439941, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1587194076258895, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5507929068185655, "dnsmos_bak": 3.936163104079545}
{"id": "nat_149", "text": "The rain fell steadily through the night.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.34097957611084, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.821490493086953, "dnsmos_sig": 3.574403273507832, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2252425781695537}
{"id": "nat_150", "text": "The lantern hung from the low beam.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.165594100952148, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9921438409370658, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6221711331657667, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5215883545671884}
{"id": "nat_151", "text": "The wind brought the smell of fresh hay.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.340885639190674, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.384981431099135, "dnsmos_sig": 3.645505525380571, "dnsmos_bak": 4.164424558584871}
{"id": "nat_152", "text": "The stone path led to the small gate.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.232740879058838, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2129666284009626, "dnsmos_sig": 3.601834728514565, "dnsmos_bak": 3.958215990317344}
{"id": "nat_153", "text": "The loud noise startled the sleeping dog.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.274065017700195, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3058734717714304, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6506754900707796, "dnsmos_bak": 3.989674724258028}
{"id": "nat_154", "text": "The canoe glided across the glassy lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.37074089050293, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1288771992097884, "dnsmos_sig": 3.542829827398962, "dnsmos_bak": 3.820268417228514}
{"id": "nat_155", "text": "The long journey left them very tired.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.3527374267578125, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0201829777581146, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5339885177401227, "dnsmos_bak": 3.661997648562262}
{"id": "nat_156", "text": "The lark sang early in the damp morning.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.386214256286621, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.236746317286589, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6383231303368473, "dnsmos_bak": 3.957417300789705}
{"id": "nat_157", "text": "The bees hummed in the tall clover.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.248759746551514, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9170550820060637, "dnsmos_sig": 3.580777520539712, "dnsmos_bak": 3.403672529898931}
{"id": "nat_158", "text": "The thick ice covered the frozen pond.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.274401664733887, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2858487303893154, "dnsmos_sig": 3.606604949786297, "dnsmos_bak": 4.027916040888946}
{"id": "nat_159", "text": "The young deer grazed near the tree line.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.479038238525391, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2804511179473526, "dnsmos_sig": 3.627918566659714, "dnsmos_bak": 4.004106325794026}
{"id": "nat_160", "text": "The heavy rains swelled the quiet river.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.287796974182129, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1140426799890646, "dnsmos_sig": 3.424646754200679, "dnsmos_bak": 4.001609305002249}
{"id": "nat_161", "text": "The steep cliff dropped to the blue sea.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.3033623695373535, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1625258617560092, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4731644814331397, "dnsmos_bak": 3.968776447427878}
{"id": "nat_162", "text": "The bright sparks flew from the anvil.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.304790496826172, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1046344552346707, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4988106627949853, "dnsmos_bak": 3.841031076478695}
{"id": "nat_163", "text": "The cold spring fed the old stone trough.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.3442487716674805, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3983555009716064, "dnsmos_sig": 3.668374218086461, "dnsmos_bak": 4.136198361412947}
{"id": "nat_164", "text": "The wild geese flew south at dusk.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.22785758972168, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3307184774000262, "dnsmos_sig": 3.647129612413142, "dnsmos_bak": 4.034318318985645}
{"id": "nat_165", "text": "The soft moss covered the old log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.340261459350586, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.358490625918646, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6662552947195484, "dnsmos_bak": 4.035168600016826}
{"id": "nat_166", "text": "The sun shone warm on the stone bench.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.320827960968018, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.438714608351724, "dnsmos_sig": 3.698538704196306, "dnsmos_bak": 4.120162828773722}
{"id": "nat_167", "text": "The fresh bread smelled good in the kitchen.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.314693450927734, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.471913592388671, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6990786526032102, "dnsmos_bak": 4.188544468388328}
{"id": "nat_168", "text": "The frog leaped from the muddy bank.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.215555667877197, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2781095406622627, "dnsmos_sig": 3.570462925638748, "dnsmos_bak": 4.068443506983995}
{"id": "nat_169", "text": "The tall ship sailed out of the harbor.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.284826278686523, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3097208927030395, "dnsmos_sig": 3.628931149543208, "dnsmos_bak": 4.004820426285575}
{"id": "nat_170", "text": "The thick smoke rose from the chimney.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.253695964813232, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2071854471431656, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5729587363249045, "dnsmos_bak": 3.888417376560747}
{"id": "nat_171", "text": "The black cat sat on the warm sill.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.343222618103027, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3376463627666975, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6317809224843636, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0951062707933525}
{"id": "nat_172", "text": "The wide valley lay green and still.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.400583744049072, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.37556256485304, "dnsmos_sig": 3.67797801399822, "dnsmos_bak": 4.133745756789274}
{"id": "nat_173", "text": "The old well ran dry in late summer.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.050163745880127, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3764146958429726, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6380837208282655, "dnsmos_bak": 4.175775401501655}
{"id": "nat_174", "text": "The cold snap froze the small brook.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.27510929107666, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2873679940494345, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5447516197097495, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1167727419466}
{"id": "nat_175", "text": "The dew dried quickly in the warm sun.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.354222297668457, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.406637014055242, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6898565467829356, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1325920202756175}
{"id": "nat_176", "text": "The sharp smell of pine filled the air.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.301614761352539, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.411982489809242, "dnsmos_sig": 3.648518744738543, "dnsmos_bak": 4.157523029163451}
{"id": "nat_177", "text": "The dog barked once and then was still.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.287729263305664, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3042076296132907, "dnsmos_sig": 3.604624747098463, "dnsmos_bak": 4.081495425015556}
{"id": "nat_178", "text": "The clay jar cracked in the dry heat.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.36474084854126, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.328585006430451, "dnsmos_sig": 3.681002732357833, "dnsmos_bak": 4.083156533547837}
{"id": "nat_179", "text": "The loom wove cloth of many colors.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.135530948638916, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.346745485121028, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6639097573778163, "dnsmos_bak": 4.056512108097801}
{"id": "nat_180", "text": "The brook flowed cold and clear all year.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6006349206349206, "utmos": 4.299008846282959, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.10608278885896, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5985303066917576, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7802324267483867}
{"id": "nat_181", "text": "The frost burned the last of the corn.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.137905120849609, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.396277892226749, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6899465623095082, "dnsmos_bak": 4.113302699770225}
{"id": "nat_182", "text": "The long canoe was carved from a log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.331683158874512, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3113509233801928, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6133724242030163, "dnsmos_bak": 4.109794345068985}
{"id": "nat_183", "text": "The roan horse ran best on flat ground.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.413992881774902, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.350948758271448, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6604064742849567, "dnsmos_bak": 4.038945411657933}
{"id": "nat_184", "text": "The fern grew thick in the dark hollow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 3.801046848297119, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3254925900195365, "dnsmos_sig": 3.609515301642096, "dnsmos_bak": 4.097468606277391}
{"id": "nat_185", "text": "The sharp taste of the brine filled his mouth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.3515849113464355, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.415930163020606, "dnsmos_sig": 3.673689717283049, "dnsmos_bak": 4.107837420198489}
{"id": "nat_186", "text": "The cart horse stood still in the rain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.409151554107666, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4443793496299953, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6687815698040613, "dnsmos_bak": 4.174096669307436}
{"id": "nat_187", "text": "The red brick house faced the park.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.36119270324707, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3364064362476555, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6240603630521875, "dnsmos_bak": 4.12760164775804}
{"id": "nat_188", "text": "The pale dawn light filled the valley.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.357616901397705, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.365412427130387, "dnsmos_sig": 3.62121955427073, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1377823201359805}
{"id": "nat_189", "text": "The dry wood burned hot and fast.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.37864351272583, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2888165061893604, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6686494843731103, "dnsmos_bak": 3.956783530644762}
{"id": "nat_190", "text": "The neural network achieved state-of-the-art performance on the benchmark.", "audio_duration_s": 3.575873015873016, "utmos": 4.305975437164307, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.389173008396427, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6308138947587962, "dnsmos_bak": 4.179896860075018}
{"id": "nat_191", "text": "Please confirm your appointment for tomorrow at three o'clock.", "audio_duration_s": 2.693514739229025, "utmos": 4.363724708557129, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4231322171595484, "dnsmos_sig": 3.656853930119167, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1726746357696305}
{"id": "nat_192", "text": "The quarterly earnings report exceeded analyst expectations by twelve percent.", "audio_duration_s": 4.133151927437642, "utmos": 4.272579193115234, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3794873265478484, "dnsmos_sig": 3.640535128079989, "dnsmos_bak": 4.163760220813708}
{"id": "nat_193", "text": "We regret to inform you that your flight has been delayed by two hours.", "audio_duration_s": 3.5294331065759637, "utmos": 4.441216468811035, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3233056086990174, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6468107514739416, "dnsmos_bak": 4.036285052848716}
{"id": "nat_194", "text": "The temperature today will reach a high of seventy-two degrees Fahrenheit.", "audio_duration_s": 3.5294331065759637, "utmos": 4.427401542663574, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3855800763207275, "dnsmos_sig": 3.69668974241499, "dnsmos_bak": 4.079348248171621}
{"id": "nat_195", "text": "Your order has been shipped and will arrive within three to five business days.", "audio_duration_s": 4.179591836734694, "utmos": 4.364840507507324, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3929009176605005, "dnsmos_sig": 3.643466408226547, "dnsmos_bak": 4.143515654544122}
{"id": "nat_196", "text": "The new software update includes several important security patches.", "audio_duration_s": 3.622312925170068, "utmos": 4.354959487915039, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3100342383824866, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6459870720096204, "dnsmos_bak": 4.010409650709311}
{"id": "nat_197", "text": "Press one for English, press two for Spanish, or stay on the line.", "audio_duration_s": 4.272471655328798, "utmos": 3.9244701862335205, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4729845038700136, "dnsmos_sig": 3.674461818738546, "dnsmos_bak": 4.19760443838577}
{"id": "nat_198", "text": "The meeting has been rescheduled to next Tuesday at two thirty PM.", "audio_duration_s": 3.5294331065759637, "utmos": 4.48103141784668, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3679975619987856, "dnsmos_sig": 3.644797439418535, "dnsmos_bak": 4.146155142415344}
{"id": "nat_199", "text": "Thank you for calling customer support. How can I assist you today?", "audio_duration_s": 3.947392290249433, "utmos": 4.412543296813965, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4819847173733307, "dnsmos_sig": 3.682186045726249, "dnsmos_bak": 4.214459544026531}
